{
  "summary": "Added comprehensive GitHub-like features: labels, milestones, issue comments, issue events audit trail, review comments with file/line references, and bidirectional issue-review links. Includes 6 stored procedures, 3 views, triggers, and default labels.",
  "learnings": [
    {
      "topic": "PostgreSQL security",
      "reminder": "Avoid GRANT TO PUBLIC - use specific roles instead. GRANT USAGE/SELECT/EXECUTE ON SCHEMA public TO PUBLIC grants to all users including public internet"
    },
    {
      "topic": "INSERT ON CONFLICT pattern",
      "reminder": "When using INSERT...ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, use RETURNING clause to get the ID, not a separate SELECT (race condition risk)"
    },
    {
      "topic": "Event audit trail",
      "reminder": "Track state changes in dedicated *_events tables with old_value/new_value columns for full audit capability"
    },
    {
      "topic": "Junction table design",
      "reminder": "Add PRIMARY KEY on both foreign keys in junction tables, with ON DELETE CASCADE on both sides"
    },
    {
      "topic": "View aggregations",
      "reminder": "Use FILTER (WHERE...) with array_agg for proper NULL handling, e.g., array_agg(DISTINCT l.name) FILTER (WHERE l.name IS NOT NULL)"
    },
    {
      "topic": "Default data migration",
      "reminder": "Insert default seed data (like labels) with ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING to make migrations idempotent"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "severity": "high",
      "location": "040_github_like_features.sql:328",
      "issue": "GRANT TO PUBLIC is a security risk - grants privileges to all users including anonymous connections",
      "suggestion": "Replace with specific role grants or remove if role permissions are managed elsewhere"
    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "location": "040_github_like_features.sql:182-184",
      "issue": "Race condition in add_issue_label - SELECT after INSERT...ON CONFLICT may return wrong row under concurrency",
      "suggestion": "Use INSERT...ON CONFLICT...RETURNING id instead of separate SELECT"
    },
    {
      "severity": "low",
      "location": "040_github_like_features.sql:300",
      "issue": "Missing updated_at trigger for review_comments table (only issue_comments has one shown)",
      "suggestion": "Verify trigger_review_comment_updated covers all comment tables or add separate triggers"
    }
  ],
  "suggestions": [
    "Add tests for the new stored procedures (assign_issue, add_issue_label, etc.)",
    "Consider adding a migration rollback script or DOWN migration",
    "Add index on issue_events(actor, created_at) for actor-based queries"
  ],
  "praise": [
    "Comprehensive feature set matching GitHub's issue workflow",
    "Proper use of CHECK constraints for enum-like fields",
    "Well-designed audit trail with event_type, actor, old_value, new_value",
    "Useful views for common queries (issues_with_labels, milestone_progress)",
    "Idempotent migrations with IF NOT EXISTS and ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING"
  ],
  "overallScore": 82,
  "codeQualityScore": 85,
  "testCoverageScore": 40,
  "documentationScore": 70
}
```

